    "message": "test: align host and panel fixtures with the revoiced library\n\nCheck defaults only for fields actually removed from legacy-state fixtures, and separately preserve retained appended controls. Treat both instrument-body model selectors as discrete in physical-value round trips.\n\nPin the two chorus controls in the panel-layout fixture to their existing captured positions, while retaining separate actual-factory-value checks. Keep every golden image and numerical tolerance unchanged.\n\nRetain screenshot candidates and run logs after failed captures without allowing failed runs to refresh published screenshots. No preset or audio-processing values change.",
